---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Home" lang="en" description="Sacro e Profano Cattery: amateur breeding of Sacred Birman and Kurilian Bobtail cats.">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1 class="wordmark hero-wordmark"><span class="sacro">Sacro</span> <span class="rest">e Profano Cattery</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">Amateur cattery breeding Sacred Birman and Kurilian Bobtail cats.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>About us</h2>
    <p>
      A short introduction to the cattery: how long it's been running, our breeding
      philosophy, and the attention we pay to our cats' health and temperament.
      <a class="text-link" href="/en/about-us">Learn more →</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="diptych">
    <article class="panel sacro-panel">
      <span class="eyebrow">The sacred</span>
      <h2>Sacred Birman</h2>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <p>Sweet and sociable temperament, with the breed's signature white "gloves" on its paws.</p>
      <a class="cta" href="/en/birmans">Discover the breed and our cats →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="panel profano-panel">
      <span class="eyebrow">The profane</span>
      <h2>Kurilian Bobtail</h2>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <p>Lively and intelligent, recognizable by its distinctive short tail.</p>
      <a class="cta" href="/en/kurilian-bobtail-section">Discover the breed and our cats →</a>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Litters</h2>
    <p>
      Follow our litters, born and upcoming.
      <a class="text-link" href="/en/litters">See our litters →</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero { padding: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem; }
  .hero-wordmark { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.75rem); }
  .lede { margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .text-link { color: var(--brass); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .text-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .diptych { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; margin: 2.5rem 0; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .diptych { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .panel {
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 1.75rem 1.75rem 2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .panel.sacro-panel { border-radius: 26px 8px 8px 8px; border-top: 3px solid var(--sacro); }
  .panel.profano-panel { border-radius: 4px 20px 4px 20px; border-top: 3px solid var(--profano); }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .sacro-panel .eyebrow { color: var(--sacro); }
  .profano-panel .eyebrow { color: var(--profano); }

  .panel h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.4rem; margin-bottom: 0; }
  .sacro-panel h2 { font-family: var(--font-display-italic); font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; }
  .profano-panel h2 { font-weight: 800; }

  .panel .rule { height: 2px; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .sacro-panel .rule { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--brass), transparent 70%); }
  .profano-panel .rule { background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--profano) 0 10px, transparent 10px 16px); height: 3px; }

  .panel p { color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .panel .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .sacro-panel .cta { color: var(--sacro); }
  .profano-panel .cta { color: var(--profano); }
  .panel .cta:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
